"use strict";$(function(){$.each($(".timeline"),function(){new InitSlider($(this))}),$.each($(".order"),function(){new CloneOrder($(this))})});var InitSlider=function(e){var i=e,n=i.find(".swiper-container"),t=i.find(".swiper-slide"),r=i.find(".timeline__pagination");new Swiper(n,{effect:"slide",speed:300,loop:!1,slidesPerView:1,threshold:10,spaceBetween:32,pagination:{el:r,clickable:!0},on:{paginationRender:function(){r.find("span").each(function(){$(this).html(t.eq($(this).index()).data("year"))})}}})},CloneOrder=function(e){e.find(".order__item")};